# pnpm 11 no longer reads settings from this file — they live in
# `pnpm-workspace.yaml` (see https://pnpm.io/settings). `node-linker=hoisted`
# and the `public-hoist-pattern` entries that used to be here were being
# silently ignored, which is what produced isolated installs and broke Metro
# ("Cannot find module 'connect'" loading metro.config.js). Both moved to
# `pnpm-workspace.yaml`; don't add settings back here expecting them to apply.
